---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="PHI & MROP | BASPLib">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-start">

        <div class="flex-1 space-y-8">
            <header class="mb-8">
                <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter mb-4 inline-block pr-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#292350] via-[#432E60] to-[#CF9E5F] bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                    PHI & MROP
                </h1>
                <h2 class="text-sm md:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6E898A] italic border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
                    Measurement model
                </h2>
            </header>

            <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#CF9E5F] pl-6 py-3 bg-[#292350]/5 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-xl font-bold text-[#2F3E5E] italic">
                    "When the galaxy map to the observation."
                </p>
            </blockquote>

            <article class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
                <p>
                    BASPLib offers a suite of utility codes for simulations in Matlab and Python.
                    The suite features two standalone libraries. The first is dedicated to the implementation of the RI measurement operator (PHI).
                    It also provides scripts for simulating a wide-variety of Fourier sampling patterns from the antenna configurations of modern telescopes.
                    The second is dedicated to the implementation of Modulated Rank-One Projection (MROP), a library for data dimensionality reduction scheme.
                </p>
            </article>

            <div class="pt-8 mt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2F3E5E] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
                    Papers & Codes
                    <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain" />
                </h3>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                    <a href="/RI_measurment_operator" class="group relative flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#292350] border border-[#292350] text-slate-100 font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#CF9E5F] hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#CF9E5F]/10 to-transparent translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-700"></div>
                        <span class="relative z-10">PHI</span>
                        <svg class="relative z-10 w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 text-[#CF9E5F]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/MROP" class="group relative flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#292350] border border-[#292350] text-slate-100 font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#CF9E5F] hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#CF9E5F]/10 to-transparent translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-700"></div>
                        <span class="relative z-10">MROP</span>
                        <svg class="relative z-10 w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 text-[#CF9E5F]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3 flex justify-center md:justify-end md:sticky top-32">
            <div class="relative group">
                <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2F3E5E]/10 to-[#CF9E5F]/10 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
                <img src="/images/falcon2.png" alt="PHI & MROP" class="relative w-64 md:w-full max-w-sm object-contain drop-shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</Layout>